        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/71c47a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-12-01T02:22:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Setback has a one-shot (<span>\"Whoops! Sorry!\"</span>) that (1)&nbsp;<span>Destroy 1 non-Character card belonging to another Hero.</span>&nbsp;(2)&nbsp;<br><span>You may destroy 1 Ongoing or Environment card </span>&nbsp;and (3)&nbsp;<span>Add or remove 3 Tokens from your Unlucky Pool.</span></p><p>Can Setback use the first item on that one-shot to remove an infection card from a hero?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>edit: corrected name of card and card text</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:56.109Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
