        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Setback has a one-shot (<span style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119); font-family: arial, sans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(248, 248, 248);\">&quot;Whoops! Sorry!&quot;</span>) that (1)&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119); font-family: arial, sans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(248, 248, 248);\">Destroy 1 non-Character card belonging to another Hero.</span>&nbsp;(2)&nbsp;<br style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119); font-family: arial, sans, sans-serif; line-height: normal; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(248, 248, 248);\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119); font-family: arial, sans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(248, 248, 248);\">You may destroy 1 Ongoing or Environment card </span>&nbsp;and (3)&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119); font-family: arial, sans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(248, 248, 248);\">Add or remove 3 Tokens from your Unlucky Pool.</span></p><p>Can Setback use the first item on that one-shot to remove an infection card from a hero?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>edit: corrected name of card and card text</p>",
